  // Commands run in a POSIX shell (source .venv/bin/activate && pytest). Avoid unnecessary nested bash -lc, zsh -lc, or sh -c wrappers. A heredoc replaces piped stdin, so a program supplied by heredoc cannot also read piped input; pass the program as an argument (python3 -c, node -e) or a script file.
