  // Load schemas for deferred tools so they can be called. Two query forms: "select:<name>[,<name>...]" loads the exact names from the "Deferred tools:" system reminder; a keyword query (e.g. "linear issue", or "+slack send" to require "slack" in the tool name) matches words in tool names and auto-loads the best matches. Prefer "select:" when you know the exact name; keywords match names only, never descriptions, so a capability no listed name suggests cannot be found by searching. A tool listed as deferred is not on `tools` until it is loaded; a tool loaded this session stays bound, so call it as `tools.<path>` from a later Script instead of loading it again.
  // Parameters:
  // - query: Query to load deferred tool schemas. Either "select:<name>[,<name>...]" with exact names from the "Deferred tools:" system reminder, or keywords (e.g. "linear issue"; prefix a term with "+" to require it in the tool name, e.g. "+slack send") that match words in tool names and auto-load the best matches.
